sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Browser
    participant P as Proxy
    participant S as Sparrow
    U->>P: GET /v1/consumers/acme/webhooks (Bearer spt_v1...)
    Note over P: path starts with /v1/consumers/ -> allowed
    P->>S: GET /v1/consumers/acme/webhooks (over VPN)
    Note over S: verify token signature + expiry,<br>check path belongs to acme
    S-->>P: 200 + JSON
    P-->>U: stream 200 back unchanged
